WHAT YOU MAY DO

  - Play with the mod, and host it on your own server, public or private.
  - Read the source, learn from it, and adapt techniques from it in your own work.
  - Report bugs, request features and open pull requests against this repository.


WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO WITHOUT WRITTEN PERMISSION

  - Re-upload the mod, in whole or in part, to the Steam Workshop or anywhere else.
  - Publish a modified, ported or translated version of it.
  - Bundle it into a public modpack or collection that HOSTS its files, rather than
    linking to the Steam Workshop item.
  - Sell it, or place it behind a paywall, donation wall or ad gate.

  Permission is usually given if you ask. Open an issue on this repository or comment on
  the Steam Workshop page.


